add_claim("THE DEFENDER TURNING-SPEED COMPLAINT, a second voice on the DLS26 problem: '**Defenders have completely lost their speed though**, and it's really annoying... **they've made it much harder to switch directions as a defender** (it takes 2 business days to start running in a different direction, and by that time the attacker is already behind your defensive line).' **A reason the double-tap clear and the backwards-running rules matter more in DLS26 than in earlier builds.**", 3, "gameplay/defender-turning-speed-complaint", [e_ps])
